{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Common.HookSumComplete","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Common.HookSumComplete","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.hookSum_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.hookSum_eq","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L181-L196","doc":"**The full hook-sum identity**, for every sorted partition (leg-sum lemma\nclosed): `Σ_c h(c) = b(λ') + b(λ) + n`, with `b(λ')` the column sum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.legPart_eq_bStat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.legPart_eq_bStat","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L163-L179","doc":"`Σ_c leg(c) = b(λ)`. Both collapse to `Σ_j C(colLen j, 2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.armPart_eq_colSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.armPart_eq_colSum","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L146-L161","doc":"`Σ_c arm(c) = b(λ')` (the column sum). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.hookSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.hookSum","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L141-L144","doc":"The hook sum `Σ_c h(c) = Σ_i Σ_{j<λ_i} (arm + leg + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.legPart","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.legPart","kind":"def","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L137-L139","doc":"The leg part `Σ_c leg(c) = Σ_i Σ_{j<λ_i} (colLen j − 1 − i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.armPart","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.armPart","kind":"def","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L133-L135","doc":"The arm part `Σ_c arm(c) = Σ_i Σ_{j<λ_i} (λ_i − 1 − j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.colSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.colSum","kind":"def","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L130-L131","doc":"`b(λ') = Σ_j (colLen j) · j` — `b` of the conjugate, as a column sum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.bStat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.bStat","kind":"def","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L127-L128","doc":"`b(λ) = Σ_i i · λ_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.sum_range_sub_rev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.sum_range_sub_rev","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L119-L125","doc":"`Σ_{i<m} i = C(m,2)` reindex helper: `Σ_{i<m}(m-1-i) = Σ_{i<m} i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.sum_cells_group","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.sum_cells_group","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L93-L117","doc":"**Cell regrouping** (the workhorse): summing any `h i j` over the cells of a\nsorted `λ` rows-first equals columns-first, `Σ_i Σ_{j<λ_i} h i j =\nΣ_j Σ_{i<colLen j} h i j`. Both iterate the same cell set `{(i,j) : j < λ_i} =\n{(i,j) : i < colLen j}` (sorted-prefix). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.sum_range_getD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.sum_range_getD","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L83-L91","doc":"`Σ_{i<len} λ_i = l.sum`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.sorted_prefix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.sorted_prefix","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L70-L81","doc":"**Sorted-prefix lemma**: for a weakly-decreasing `λ`, the rows exceeding\ncolumn `j` are exactly `{0, …, colLen j − 1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.colLen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.colLen","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L66-L68","doc":"Column length `colLen λ j = #{ i : λ_i > j }`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumComplete.downward_closed_eq_range","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumComplete.downward_closed_eq_range","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumComplete.lean#L41-L64","doc":"A `≤`-downward-closed finite subset of `ℕ` is an initial segment. ","signatureChunk":0}]}